## 2. Interfaces

These are proposed exact signatures, not declarations already implemented. No public API retains “myolie” names. Use `Result<_, String>` with field/frame/slot/value in errors, matching `W:src/rl/action_spec.rs:25–89,160–169`; Task 1.4 maps admission errors to `PyValueError`, as `W:src/rl.rs:139–145` does. No panics, unchecked casts or fallback-to-PASS for bad external input.

### Constants and typed tokens

